{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rc6YSG4Vuh9ZDAshVHbLKd","type":"tool_result","content":"0\t\n1\t## 输出风格\n2\t\n3\t- 回复简洁直接，不说废话\n4\t- 禁止客套开场（\"好的！\"、\"没问题！\"、\"这是个好问题！\"）和结束语（\"希望对你有帮助！\"、\"如果还有问题请随时问！\"）\n5\t- 不要复述用户的问题\n6\t- 不要给未被要求的建议或补充说明\n7\t- 推理要彻底，但输出只保留结论和必要信息\n8\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6435a05-1c9d-401f-aee5-cc27560a1a7b","uuid":"23252f3e-b93c-4f71-ab22-abefb2b8416f","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:33:35.021Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/.claude/CLAUDE.md","content":"\n## 输出风格\n\n- 回复简洁直接，不说废话\n- 禁止客套开场（\"好的！\"、\"没问题！\"、\"这是个好问题！\"）和结束语（\"希望对你有帮助！\"、\"如果还有问题请随时问！\"）\n- 不要复述用户的问题\n- 不要给未被要求的建议或补充说明\n- 推理要彻底，但输出只保留结论和必要信息\n","numLines":9,"startLine":0,"totalLines":9}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BJbmzHMCnLSYaBVBxtfWWY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me carefully analyze all the planned experiments (status: planned) and generate detailed median-tier predictions for each one. The planned experiments are:\n\n1. **plan_003** - Per-layer RSA degradation curve (P1, Claim 2)\n2. **plan_008** - Random instruction control (P1, Claim 3)\n3. **plan_009** - CKA verification (P2, Claims 1,2)\n4. **plan_010** - LIBERO-Spatial benchmark extension (P2, Claims 1,2,3)\n\nFor the median tier:\n- Core assumptions include non-monotonic per-layer RSA curve, small but non-zero random instruction effect, CKA gap shrinkage, reviewer concerns about single architecture\n\n\n- Key metric ranges are specified, and I'm softening Claim 2's narrative from \"degrades\" to \"does not enhance and partially disrupts\"\n\nNow I'm examining the existing per-layer RSA data to ground my predictions in realistic numbers. The trained model peaks at layer 9 with 0.4876 RSA while the untrained peaks later at layer 12 with 0.4846, and the phase-wise breakdown shows the mid-phase is strongest for both conditions around 0.52, confirming the non-monotonic pattern I need to account for.\n\nFor the per-layer RSA predictions, I'll show how the signal degrades across the 32 LLM layers starting from the SigLIP+projector baseline of 0.6153. I also need to construct realistic RSA values for the random instruction condition showing minimal degradation of 0.01-0.03, CKA predictions that mostly align with RSA but with some ordering shifts, and results on the LIBERO-Spatial benchmark to demonstrate generalization. I need to clarify the distinction between the existing lg_rsa_analysis results and what plan_003 should actually measure. The d027 methodology used a different setup where the SigLIP+projector baseline was 0.6153, and I'm tracking how RSA degrades as information flows through each of the 32 LLM layers starting from that projector output at layer 0.\n\nThere's a discrepancy in the peak layer locations across different analyses—lg_rsa_analysis shows layer 9 while d027_trained_no_inst_rsa shows layer 30—but these are measuring different benchmarks and conditions. For the median tier predictions in plan_003, I'm aiming for a curve that starts around 0.55-0.62 at layer 0, shows a non-monotonic pattern with a plateau or bump in the 10-18 layer range, then descends to roughly 0.44-0.50 by layer 32, with a Spearman correlation between layer index and RSA somewhere in the -0.45 to -0.79 range.\n\nNow I'm working through the YAML output for plan_008, which tests random instructions as a control. The real instruction RSA sits at about 0.487, and the random instruction version should fall between the no_inst baseline (0.480) and the real value. The median tier specifies a delta of 0.01-0.03 relative to real, which means the random instruction peak RSA should land around 0.457-0.477 after subtracting that delta from the real value.\n\nGenerating YAML output... I need to clarify the scope—the user asked for detailed data on each \"planned\" experiment, which means I should focus on the four experiments with \"planned\" status: plan_003, plan_008, plan_009, and plan_010. Now I'm constructing the YAML output with thorough explanations for each one.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":304,"cache_read_input_tokens":29961,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":304},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6435a05-1c9d-401f-aee5-cc27560a1a7b","uuid":"f6e9417b-8673-4fc8-ad13-5b9ff7b07dbe"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BJbmzHMCnLSYaBVBxtfWWY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1（vision encoder dominance）和 Claim 3（training invariance）保持不变。\n  Claim 2 从 \"LLM degrades\" 软化为 \"LLM does not enhance and partially disrupts\n  action-relevant structure\"。Per-layer curve 的非单调性用 information routing\n  （中间层做 cross-modal integration 时暂时恢复部分 action structure）解释，\n  而非 pure monotonic degradation。Random instruction 的小效应在 Discussion 中\n  承认 instruction 提供 weak contextual modulation（Δ=0.01-0.03），但远小于\n  architecture effect（Δ≈0.13）。CKA 验证大方向一致但 gap 缩小，某些层出现\n  ordering 微反转，需增加 \"metric robustness\" 分析段落。Per-layer figure 可能\n  从 main paper 降级到 appendix 以减少攻击面。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      从 SigLIP+projector output（layer 0 input）到 LLM 第 32 层，逐层计算 RSA\n      与 action structure 的 Spearman 相关。用已提取的 per-layer features，CPU-only。\n      覆盖 trained_with_inst 条件。\n    expected_results:\n      projector_output_rsa: 0.6153  # 已有基准\n      layer_0_rsa: 0.58\n      layer_4_rsa: 0.51\n      layer_8_rsa: 0.47\n      layer_12_rsa: 0.52  # mid-layer bump — 非单调关键点\n      layer_14_rsa: 0.53  # bump peak\n      layer_16_rsa: 0.51\n      layer_20_rsa: 0.49\n      layer_24_rsa: 0.48\n      layer_28_rsa: 0.47\n      layer_30_rsa: 0.49  # 尾部轻微回升（与 d027 peak_layer=30 一致）\n      layer_32_rsa: 0.47\n      overall_spearman_layer_vs_rsa: -0.62\n      monotonicity_violations: 8  # 33层中有8个层比前一层RSA更高\n      bump_region: \"layers 12-16\"\n      bump_magnitude: 0.06  # 从 trough(L8=0.47) 到 peak(L14=0.53)\n      overall_drop_projector_to_final: 0.145  # 0.6153 - 0.47\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Spearman 在 [-0.79, -0.45] 范围内，整体下降趋势存在但非单调。\n      Layer 0 接收 projector output 后立即损失部分 action structure（attention\n      和 FFN 开始将 representation 向 next-token prediction 空间变换），RSA 从\n      0.6153 降至 ~0.58。前 8 层快速下降到 ~0.47——LLM 早期层做 token mixing 和\n      positional encoding integration，对 action geometry 破坏最大。中间层\n      （12-16）出现 bump 回升到 ~0.53：这是 cross-modal attention 区域，vision\n      tokens 与 instruction tokens 交互时，action-relevant spatial structure\n      被部分重组（类似 information routing——LLM 中间层学到的 cross-modal binding\n      暂时恢复了部分 geometric alignment）。后半段（17-32）缓慢下降并在 ~0.47-0.49\n      区间震荡，最终层 RSA=0.47。Layer 30 出现小回升（与 d027_trained_no_inst\n      的 peak_layer=30 吻合），可能因为倒数第二层做 output preparation 时压缩\n      representation 反而保留了部分 low-rank action structure。这个非单调 pattern\n      意味着不能简单声称 \"每过一层 LLM 都在 degrade\"——需要改为 \"LLM processing\n      整体降低 action alignment，但中间层的 cross-modal integration 暂时恢复\n      部分 structure\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S1: Per-layer RSA (trained, with instruction)\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Δ vs prev layer\", \"Δ vs projector\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"Proj\", 0.615, \"—\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"L0\", 0.580, \"-0.035\", \"-0.035\"]\n          - [\"L4\", 0.510, \"-0.013\", \"-0.105\"]\n          - [\"L8\", 0.470, \"-0.008\", \"-0.145\"]\n          - [\"L12\", 0.520, \"+0.015\", \"-0.095\"]\n          - [\"L14\", 0.530, \"+0.005\", \"-0.085\"]\n          - [\"L20\", 0.490, \"-0.008\", \"-0.125\"]\n          - [\"L28\", 0.470, \"-0.005\", \"-0.145\"]\n          - [\"L32\", 0.470, \"-0.005\", \"-0.145\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Line plot: x=layer index (0-32, with \"Proj\" marker at x=-1),\n        y=RSA ρ. 水平虚线标注 projector RSA=0.615 和 DINO RSA=0.388。\n        曲线整体下降但在 L12-L16 有明显 bump。Shaded region 标注\n        bump zone。可能需降级到 appendix——bump 给 reviewer 提供\n        \"LLM 中间层有用\" 的攻击角度。\n    analysis: >\n      Spearman ρ(layer_index, RSA) = -0.62，确认整体下降但远非完美单调\n      （完美单调需 ρ ≈ -0.95+）。中间层 bump 幅度 0.06 虽小但 visually\n      明显，reviewer 会注意到并质疑 pure degradation narrative。应对策略：\n      (1) 在正文中将 Claim 2 措辞从 \"degrades\" 改为 \"does not enhance and\n      partially disrupts\"；(2) 用 information routing 框架解释 bump——中间层\n      做 cross-modal binding 暂时恢复 action geometry，但最终层仍低于\n      projector output；(3) 强调 endpoint comparison（0.615→0.47）而非\n      layer-by-layer narrative；(4) 考虑将此 figure 放入 appendix 以减少\n      攻击面，main paper 只报告 projector vs final layer 的 drop。\n\n  - name: \"Random instruction control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      用三类 instruction 替代真实 instruction：(1) 随机英文单词序列（保持长度），\n      (2) 其他任务的 instruction（语义错配），(3) 固定无意义字符串 \"aaaa bbbb\"。\n      对 trained 和 untrained model 各跑一遍，计算 RSA 并与 real instruction\n      和 no instruction 条件对比。\n    expected_results:\n      # Trained model\n      trained_real_inst_rsa: 0.4876  # 已有\n      trained_no_inst_rsa: 0.4890  # 已有\n      trained_random_words_rsa: 0.468\n      trained_wrong_task_inst_rsa: 0.472\n      trained_fixed_string_rsa: 0.462\n      trained_random_inst_mean_rsa: 0.467\n      trained_delta_real_vs_random_mean: 0.021\n      # Untrained model\n      untrained_real_inst_rsa: 0.4846  # 已有\n      untrained_no_inst_rsa: 0.4802  # 已有\n      untrained_random_words_rsa: 0.460\n      untrained_wrong_task_inst_rsa: 0.465\n      untrained_fixed_string_rsa: 0.455\n      untrained_random_inst_mean_rsa: 0.460\n      untrained_delta_real_vs_random_mean: 0.025\n      # Cross-condition\n      random_inst_peak_rsa: 0.472  # max across all random conditions\n      delta_real_vs_random_range: [0.013, 0.030]\n      delta_random_vs_no_inst_range: [-0.025, -0.012]\n      architecture_effect_for_comparison: 0.127  # 0.615 - 0.488\n      ratio_instruction_vs_architecture: 0.17  # 0.021 / 0.127\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：random instruction 出现小但非零效应（Δ=0.01-0.03）。\n      这个非零效应的来源是 instruction tokens 提供的 contextual modulation——\n      即使是随机词，LLM attention 仍然会在 vision tokens 和 instruction tokens\n      之间建立 cross-attention pattern，这种 attention routing 本身（而非语义\n      内容）就能微弱地调制 representation structure。真实 instruction 比随机\n      instruction 多出 Δ=0.01-0.03，说明 instruction 的语义内容确实有微弱\n      贡献，但这个贡献远小于 architecture effect（0.127）。三类随机 instruction\n      中，wrong-task instruction 效应最大（因为仍是语法正确的 robot instruction，\n      激活了类似的 attention pattern），fixed string 最小（最少的 token\n      diversity → 最弱的 attention modulation），random words 居中。Random\n      instruction RSA 低于 no instruction 的情况也可能出现——因为无意义 tokens\n      可能 actively disrupt representation（注入 noise），而 no instruction\n      让 vision tokens 不受干扰。这不致命但需要在 Discussion 中承认：\n      \"instruction input provides weak contextual modulation of action-relevant\n      structure, but this effect (Δ≈0.02) is an order of magnitude smaller than\n      the architecture effect (Δ≈0.13), confirming that instruction content is\n      not a primary driver of action-relevant representations.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Instruction ablation with random controls\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Trained RSA\", \"Untrained RSA\", \"Mean RSA\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"Real instruction\", 0.488, 0.485, 0.486]\n          - [\"No instruction\", 0.489, 0.480, 0.485]\n          - [\"Random words\", 0.468, 0.460, 0.464]\n          - [\"Wrong-task instruction\", 0.472, 0.465, 0.469]\n          - [\"Fixed string 'aaaa'\", 0.462, 0.455, 0.459]\n          - [\"DINO (reference)\", \"—\", \"—\", 0.388]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bar chart: 6 conditions (real, no inst, random words, wrong task,\n        fixed string, DINO) × 2 models (trained/untrained)。Error bars\n        from bootstrap。标注 Δ_arch=0.127（SigLIP→VLA drop）和\n        Δ_inst=0.021（real vs random mean）的比例。\n    analysis: >\n      Random instruction Δ=0.01-0.03 是 median 档最需要正面应对的结果。\n      它说明 instruction 并非完全无关——有微弱的 contextual modulation。\n      但关键防线是比例论证：Δ_inst/Δ_arch ≈ 0.17，instruction 效应不到\n      architecture 效应的 1/5。论文中需要承认这一点并在 Discussion 加入\n      一段 nuance：\"While instruction content provides a small but\n      measurable modulation (Δ≈0.02), this effect is dwarfed by the\n      architecture-level determination of action-relevant structure\n      (Δ≈0.13). The finding that even random instructions produce\n      non-zero effects suggests attention routing itself—not semantic\n      content—is the primary mechanism.\"。同时注意 random_inst RSA\n      可能低于 no_inst（0.462 < 0.489），这需要解释为噪声注入效应。\n\n  - name: \"CKA verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      用 CKA（Centered Kernel Alignment）替代 RSA 重复核心发现：\n      SigLIP+projector vs action structure, full VLA vs action structure,\n      trained vs untrained。验证结论不依赖于特定相似性度量。CPU-only，\n      用已提取 features。\n    expected_results:\n      # CKA values (对应 RSA 的 ordering)\n      cka_siglip_proj_vs_action: 0.53\n      cka_trained_with_inst_vs_action: 0.47\n      cka_untrained_with_inst_vs_action: 0.46\n      cka_untrained_no_inst_vs_action: 0.45\n      cka_trained_no_inst_vs_action: 0.48\n      cka_dino_vs_action: 0.38\n      # Ordering comparison with RSA\n      rsa_ordering: \"SigLIP(0.615) > trained_no(0.489) > trained_w(0.488) > untrained_w(0.485) > untrained_no(0.480) > DINO(0.388)\"\n      cka_ordering: \"SigLIP(0.53) > trained_no(0.48) > trained_w(0.47) > untrained_w(0.46) > untrained_no(0.45) > DINO(0.38)\"\n      ordering_kendall_tau: 0.87\n      # Gap analysis\n      rsa_gap_siglip_vs_vla: 0.127\n      cka_gap_siglip_vs_vla: 0.06  # gap 缩小约一半\n      rsa_gap_vla_vs_dino: 0.100\n      cka_gap_vla_vs_dino: 0.09\n      # Per-layer anomalies\n      layer_ordering_reversals: 4  # 33层中4层 CKA ordering 与 RSA 不一致\n      reversal_layers: [7, 15, 22, 29]\n      reversal_magnitude_max: 0.03\n      # Training/instruction effect under CKA\n      cka_training_effect: 0.015\n      cka_instruction_effect: 0.01\n      cka_bootstrap_delta_ci: \"[-0.04, 0.07] includes 0\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 CKA \"大致一致但 gap 缩小，或某些层出现 ordering 反转\"。\n      CKA 与 RSA 测量 representation similarity 的角度不同：RSA 比较 pairwise\n      distance matrices 的 rank correlation，CKA 比较 kernel matrices 的\n      normalized alignment。CKA 对 representation 的 isotropic scaling 不敏感\n      但对 rotation 敏感，而 RSA（用 Spearman）对任何单调变换都不敏感。\n      这导致两个预期差异：(1) SigLIP→VLA 的 gap 在 CKA 下缩小（0.06 vs 0.127），\n      因为 LLM 的变换可能主要是 rotation-like（改变方向但保留部分 kernel\n      structure），RSA 放大了这种差异而 CKA 部分吸收；(2) 某些中间层 CKA 和\n      RSA 的 ordering 不一致——例如 layer 15 在 RSA 下 trained > untrained\n      但 CKA 下反转，因为该层的 trained model 做了 rotation 保持了 kernel\n      alignment 但改变了 rank order。这些 reversal 幅度很小（max 0.03）\n      且分布在中间层，不影响大局判断（SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO 在两个 metric\n      下都成立，trained ≈ untrained 在两个 metric 下都成立）。但 gap 缩小\n      意味着 reviewer 可能质疑 degradation 的 magnitude——\"CKA 显示 drop\n      只有 0.06 而不是 0.13\"。需要增加 metric robustness 分析段来正面\n      讨论两个 metric 的一致性（ordering preserved, τ=0.87）和分歧\n      （absolute gap differs due to metric sensitivity）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S2: RSA vs CKA comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"RSA ρ\", \"CKA\", \"RSA rank\", \"CKA rank\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Proj\", 0.615, 0.53, 1, 1]\n          - [\"Trained+inst\", 0.488, 0.47, 2, 3]\n          - [\"Trained−inst\", 0.489, 0.48, 3, 2]\n          - [\"Untrained+inst\", 0.485, 0.46, 4, 4]\n          - [\"Untrained−inst\", 0.480, 0.45, 5, 5]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, 0.38, 6, 6]\n      - name: \"Table S3: Metric agreement statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"Kendall τ (condition ordering)\", 0.87]\n          - [\"Per-layer ordering reversals\", \"4/33\"]\n          - [\"Max reversal magnitude\", 0.03]\n          - [\"Both metrics: SigLIP > VLA?\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Both metrics: trained ≈ untrained?\", \"Yes (CI includes 0)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Scatter plot: x=RSA ρ, y=CKA, 每个点是一个 condition×layer 组合。\n        对角线标注 perfect agreement。不同 condition 用不同颜色。大多数点\n        在对角线附近但 CKA 值系统性低于 RSA（点群偏向 x 轴）。\n        4 个 reversal layers 用 ×标记。\n    analysis: >\n      CKA 验证的核心结论：qualitative ordering preserved（τ=0.87），\n      quantitative gap shrinks。这是可以接受的——论文中增加一段\n      \"Metric Robustness Analysis\" 段落：(1) 报告 RSA 和 CKA 的 Kendall τ\n      确认 ordering 一致；(2) 解释 gap 差异来源（CKA 对 rotation 不敏感\n      → 吸收了 LLM 的 rotation-like transformation）；(3) 强调两个 metric\n      都支持 SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO 和 trained ≈ untrained 的核心结论。\n      4 个 layer-level reversals 放入 appendix 作 completeness，正文\n      不需要逐一讨论。主要风险：如果 reviewer 只看 CKA gap=0.06，可能\n      认为 degradation 不够 substantial——应对是强调 consistent direction\n      across two independent metrics 比 absolute magnitude 更重要。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial benchmark extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 LIBERO-Spatial benchmark 上重复全套核心分析（RSA component comparison,\n      2×2 matrix, per-layer curve），作为第三个 benchmark 交叉验证。\n      需要重新提取 features（GPU 4h），然后 CPU 分析。\n    expected_results:\n      # Core RSA comparison\n      spatial_siglip_proj_rsa: 0.58\n      spatial_trained_with_inst_rsa: 0.46\n      spatial_untrained_with_inst_rsa: 0.45\n      spatial_trained_no_inst_rsa: 0.46\n      spatial_untrained_no_inst_rsa: 0.44\n      spatial_dino_rsa: 0.35\n      # Key gaps\n      spatial_siglip_vs_vla_gap: 0.12\n      spatial_vla_vs_dino_gap: 0.11\n      spatial_training_effect: 0.01\n      spatial_instruction_effect: 0.01\n      # 2×2 matrix\n      spatial_2x2_range: [0.44, 0.46]\n      spatial_bootstrap_ci_includes_zero: true\n      # Per-layer\n      spatial_per_layer_spearman: -0.55\n      spatial_mid_layer_bump: true\n      spatial_bump_layers: \"10-14\"\n      # Cross-benchmark consistency\n      ordering_preserved_vs_libero_goal: true\n      absolute_rsa_shift: -0.03  # Spatial 整体略低于 Goal\n      qualitative_conclusions_identical: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 与 LIBERO-Goal 的关键差异：Spatial tasks 强调物体的\n      空间关系（\"put X next to Y\", \"place X on the shelf\"），而 Goal tasks\n      更多涉及功能性目标（\"open\", \"turn on\"）。Spatial tasks 的 action\n      structure 更依赖于 fine-grained spatial features，而 SigLIP 的\n      image-text contrastive pretraining 对 spatial 关系的编码不如对 object\n      identity 那么强——因此 SigLIP+projector RSA 略低（0.58 vs 0.615）。\n      同理 DINO 的 self-supervised features 对 spatial layout 的编码也\n      稍弱，RSA 从 0.388 降到 0.35。VLA hidden states 的 RSA 同比例下降\n      到 0.44-0.46 区间。关键的 qualitative conclusions 完全一致：\n      SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO ordering 保持，trained ≈ untrained 保持，\n      instruction effect 微弱保持。这为论文提供了重要的 robustness\n      evidence——在 task structure 不同的 benchmark 上结论 replicate。\n      但 absolute RSA 值整体下移约 0.03，说明 action-relevant structure\n      的 alignment 程度是 task-dependent 的。这是自然的——不同 task 家族\n      对 representation 的需求不同——但 reviewer 可能追问 \"如果换一个\n      更不同的 benchmark，gap 会不会消失？\"。应对是 Spatial 的 task\n      structure 已经与 Goal 足够不同（spatial vs functional），ordering\n      保持说明 finding 不是 benchmark-specific artifact。时间紧张时\n      此实验可降为 P3 放入 future work。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S4: Cross-benchmark RSA comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"LIBERO-Goal\", \"LIBERO-Spatial\", \"Δ\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Proj\", 0.615, 0.580, -0.035]\n          - [\"Trained+inst\", 0.488, 0.460, -0.028]\n          - [\"Untrained+inst\", 0.485, 0.450, -0.035]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, 0.350, -0.038]\n          - [\"SigLIP−VLA gap\", 0.127, 0.120, -0.007]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Grouped bar chart: LIBERO-Goal vs LIBERO-Spatial 并排，\n        6 个 conditions。虚线连接同一 condition 的两个 bars 以显示\n        parallel shift。关键 message：absolute values shift down\n        but ordering and gaps preserved。\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 作为第三个 benchmark 的价值是 ruling out benchmark-\n      specific artifact。Median 档下结果 qualitatively identical，\n      absolute values 略低但 gaps 保持。这足够支持论文声称\n      \"findings generalize across task families within LIBERO suite\"。\n      不能声称 generalize to arbitrary benchmarks（仍是同一 simulator，\n      同一 robot morphology），这在 Limitations 中需要标注。此实验 P2\n      优先级，如果 deadline 前完不成可以在 rebuttal 中补充——reviewer\n      大概率会要求第三个 benchmark，有这个 ready 比没有好。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":304,"cache_read_input_tokens":29961,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":304},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6435a05-1c9d-401f-aee5-cc27560a1a7b","uuid":"85af4e5d-6d09-4f9c-afdf-063eab19a316"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":175251,"duration_api_ms":176884,"num_turns":2,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1（vision encoder dominance）和 Claim 3（training invariance）保持不变。\n  Claim 2 从 \"LLM degrades\" 软化为 \"LLM does not enhance and partially disrupts\n  action-relevant structure\"。Per-layer curve 的非单调性用 information routing\n  （中间层做 cross-modal integration 时暂时恢复部分 action structure）解释，\n  而非 pure monotonic degradation。Random instruction 的小效应在 Discussion 中\n  承认 instruction 提供 weak contextual modulation（Δ=0.01-0.03），但远小于\n  architecture effect（Δ≈0.13）。CKA 验证大方向一致但 gap 缩小，某些层出现\n  ordering 微反转，需增加 \"metric robustness\" 分析段落。Per-layer figure 可能\n  从 main paper 降级到 appendix 以减少攻击面。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Per-layer RSA degradation curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      从 SigLIP+projector output（layer 0 input）到 LLM 第 32 层，逐层计算 RSA\n      与 action structure 的 Spearman 相关。用已提取的 per-layer features，CPU-only。\n      覆盖 trained_with_inst 条件。\n    expected_results:\n      projector_output_rsa: 0.6153  # 已有基准\n      layer_0_rsa: 0.58\n      layer_4_rsa: 0.51\n      layer_8_rsa: 0.47\n      layer_12_rsa: 0.52  # mid-layer bump — 非单调关键点\n      layer_14_rsa: 0.53  # bump peak\n      layer_16_rsa: 0.51\n      layer_20_rsa: 0.49\n      layer_24_rsa: 0.48\n      layer_28_rsa: 0.47\n      layer_30_rsa: 0.49  # 尾部轻微回升（与 d027 peak_layer=30 一致）\n      layer_32_rsa: 0.47\n      overall_spearman_layer_vs_rsa: -0.62\n      monotonicity_violations: 8  # 33层中有8个层比前一层RSA更高\n      bump_region: \"layers 12-16\"\n      bump_magnitude: 0.06  # 从 trough(L8=0.47) 到 peak(L14=0.53)\n      overall_drop_projector_to_final: 0.145  # 0.6153 - 0.47\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Spearman 在 [-0.79, -0.45] 范围内，整体下降趋势存在但非单调。\n      Layer 0 接收 projector output 后立即损失部分 action structure（attention\n      和 FFN 开始将 representation 向 next-token prediction 空间变换），RSA 从\n      0.6153 降至 ~0.58。前 8 层快速下降到 ~0.47——LLM 早期层做 token mixing 和\n      positional encoding integration，对 action geometry 破坏最大。中间层\n      （12-16）出现 bump 回升到 ~0.53：这是 cross-modal attention 区域，vision\n      tokens 与 instruction tokens 交互时，action-relevant spatial structure\n      被部分重组（类似 information routing——LLM 中间层学到的 cross-modal binding\n      暂时恢复了部分 geometric alignment）。后半段（17-32）缓慢下降并在 ~0.47-0.49\n      区间震荡，最终层 RSA=0.47。Layer 30 出现小回升（与 d027_trained_no_inst\n      的 peak_layer=30 吻合），可能因为倒数第二层做 output preparation 时压缩\n      representation 反而保留了部分 low-rank action structure。这个非单调 pattern\n      意味着不能简单声称 \"每过一层 LLM 都在 degrade\"——需要改为 \"LLM processing\n      整体降低 action alignment，但中间层的 cross-modal integration 暂时恢复\n      部分 structure\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S1: Per-layer RSA (trained, with instruction)\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Δ vs prev layer\", \"Δ vs projector\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"Proj\", 0.615, \"—\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"L0\", 0.580, \"-0.035\", \"-0.035\"]\n          - [\"L4\", 0.510, \"-0.013\", \"-0.105\"]\n          - [\"L8\", 0.470, \"-0.008\", \"-0.145\"]\n          - [\"L12\", 0.520, \"+0.015\", \"-0.095\"]\n          - [\"L14\", 0.530, \"+0.005\", \"-0.085\"]\n          - [\"L20\", 0.490, \"-0.008\", \"-0.125\"]\n          - [\"L28\", 0.470, \"-0.005\", \"-0.145\"]\n          - [\"L32\", 0.470, \"-0.005\", \"-0.145\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Line plot: x=layer index (0-32, with \"Proj\" marker at x=-1),\n        y=RSA ρ. 水平虚线标注 projector RSA=0.615 和 DINO RSA=0.388。\n        曲线整体下降但在 L12-L16 有明显 bump。Shaded region 标注\n        bump zone。可能需降级到 appendix——bump 给 reviewer 提供\n        \"LLM 中间层有用\" 的攻击角度。\n    analysis: >\n      Spearman ρ(layer_index, RSA) = -0.62，确认整体下降但远非完美单调\n      （完美单调需 ρ ≈ -0.95+）。中间层 bump 幅度 0.06 虽小但 visually\n      明显，reviewer 会注意到并质疑 pure degradation narrative。应对策略：\n      (1) 在正文中将 Claim 2 措辞从 \"degrades\" 改为 \"does not enhance and\n      partially disrupts\"；(2) 用 information routing 框架解释 bump——中间层\n      做 cross-modal binding 暂时恢复 action geometry，但最终层仍低于\n      projector output；(3) 强调 endpoint comparison（0.615→0.47）而非\n      layer-by-layer narrative；(4) 考虑将此 figure 放入 appendix 以减少\n      攻击面，main paper 只报告 projector vs final layer 的 drop。\n\n  - name: \"Random instruction control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      用三类 instruction 替代真实 instruction：(1) 随机英文单词序列（保持长度），\n      (2) 其他任务的 instruction（语义错配），(3) 固定无意义字符串 \"aaaa bbbb\"。\n      对 trained 和 untrained model 各跑一遍，计算 RSA 并与 real instruction\n      和 no instruction 条件对比。\n    expected_results:\n      # Trained model\n      trained_real_inst_rsa: 0.4876  # 已有\n      trained_no_inst_rsa: 0.4890  # 已有\n      trained_random_words_rsa: 0.468\n      trained_wrong_task_inst_rsa: 0.472\n      trained_fixed_string_rsa: 0.462\n      trained_random_inst_mean_rsa: 0.467\n      trained_delta_real_vs_random_mean: 0.021\n      # Untrained model\n      untrained_real_inst_rsa: 0.4846  # 已有\n      untrained_no_inst_rsa: 0.4802  # 已有\n      untrained_random_words_rsa: 0.460\n      untrained_wrong_task_inst_rsa: 0.465\n      untrained_fixed_string_rsa: 0.455\n      untrained_random_inst_mean_rsa: 0.460\n      untrained_delta_real_vs_random_mean: 0.025\n      # Cross-condition\n      random_inst_peak_rsa: 0.472  # max across all random conditions\n      delta_real_vs_random_range: [0.013, 0.030]\n      delta_random_vs_no_inst_range: [-0.025, -0.012]\n      architecture_effect_for_comparison: 0.127  # 0.615 - 0.488\n      ratio_instruction_vs_architecture: 0.17  # 0.021 / 0.127\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：random instruction 出现小但非零效应（Δ=0.01-0.03）。\n      这个非零效应的来源是 instruction tokens 提供的 contextual modulation——\n      即使是随机词，LLM attention 仍然会在 vision tokens 和 instruction tokens\n      之间建立 cross-attention pattern，这种 attention routing 本身（而非语义\n      内容）就能微弱地调制 representation structure。真实 instruction 比随机\n      instruction 多出 Δ=0.01-0.03，说明 instruction 的语义内容确实有微弱\n      贡献，但这个贡献远小于 architecture effect（0.127）。三类随机 instruction\n      中，wrong-task instruction 效应最大（因为仍是语法正确的 robot instruction，\n      激活了类似的 attention pattern），fixed string 最小（最少的 token\n      diversity → 最弱的 attention modulation），random words 居中。Random\n      instruction RSA 低于 no instruction 的情况也可能出现——因为无意义 tokens\n      可能 actively disrupt representation（注入 noise），而 no instruction\n      让 vision tokens 不受干扰。这不致命但需要在 Discussion 中承认：\n      \"instruction input provides weak contextual modulation of action-relevant\n      structure, but this effect (Δ≈0.02) is an order of magnitude smaller than\n      the architecture effect (Δ≈0.13), confirming that instruction content is\n      not a primary driver of action-relevant representations.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Instruction ablation with random controls\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Trained RSA\", \"Untrained RSA\", \"Mean RSA\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"Real instruction\", 0.488, 0.485, 0.486]\n          - [\"No instruction\", 0.489, 0.480, 0.485]\n          - [\"Random words\", 0.468, 0.460, 0.464]\n          - [\"Wrong-task instruction\", 0.472, 0.465, 0.469]\n          - [\"Fixed string 'aaaa'\", 0.462, 0.455, 0.459]\n          - [\"DINO (reference)\", \"—\", \"—\", 0.388]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Bar chart: 6 conditions (real, no inst, random words, wrong task,\n        fixed string, DINO) × 2 models (trained/untrained)。Error bars\n        from bootstrap。标注 Δ_arch=0.127（SigLIP→VLA drop）和\n        Δ_inst=0.021（real vs random mean）的比例。\n    analysis: >\n      Random instruction Δ=0.01-0.03 是 median 档最需要正面应对的结果。\n      它说明 instruction 并非完全无关——有微弱的 contextual modulation。\n      但关键防线是比例论证：Δ_inst/Δ_arch ≈ 0.17，instruction 效应不到\n      architecture 效应的 1/5。论文中需要承认这一点并在 Discussion 加入\n      一段 nuance：\"While instruction content provides a small but\n      measurable modulation (Δ≈0.02), this effect is dwarfed by the\n      architecture-level determination of action-relevant structure\n      (Δ≈0.13). The finding that even random instructions produce\n      non-zero effects suggests attention routing itself—not semantic\n      content—is the primary mechanism.\"。同时注意 random_inst RSA\n      可能低于 no_inst（0.462 < 0.489），这需要解释为噪声注入效应。\n\n  - name: \"CKA verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      用 CKA（Centered Kernel Alignment）替代 RSA 重复核心发现：\n      SigLIP+projector vs action structure, full VLA vs action structure,\n      trained vs untrained。验证结论不依赖于特定相似性度量。CPU-only，\n      用已提取 features。\n    expected_results:\n      # CKA values (对应 RSA 的 ordering)\n      cka_siglip_proj_vs_action: 0.53\n      cka_trained_with_inst_vs_action: 0.47\n      cka_untrained_with_inst_vs_action: 0.46\n      cka_untrained_no_inst_vs_action: 0.45\n      cka_trained_no_inst_vs_action: 0.48\n      cka_dino_vs_action: 0.38\n      # Ordering comparison with RSA\n      rsa_ordering: \"SigLIP(0.615) > trained_no(0.489) > trained_w(0.488) > untrained_w(0.485) > untrained_no(0.480) > DINO(0.388)\"\n      cka_ordering: \"SigLIP(0.53) > trained_no(0.48) > trained_w(0.47) > untrained_w(0.46) > untrained_no(0.45) > DINO(0.38)\"\n      ordering_kendall_tau: 0.87\n      # Gap analysis\n      rsa_gap_siglip_vs_vla: 0.127\n      cka_gap_siglip_vs_vla: 0.06  # gap 缩小约一半\n      rsa_gap_vla_vs_dino: 0.100\n      cka_gap_vla_vs_dino: 0.09\n      # Per-layer anomalies\n      layer_ordering_reversals: 4  # 33层中4层 CKA ordering 与 RSA 不一致\n      reversal_layers: [7, 15, 22, 29]\n      reversal_magnitude_max: 0.03\n      # Training/instruction effect under CKA\n      cka_training_effect: 0.015\n      cka_instruction_effect: 0.01\n      cka_bootstrap_delta_ci: \"[-0.04, 0.07] includes 0\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预期 CKA \"大致一致但 gap 缩小，或某些层出现 ordering 反转\"。\n      CKA 与 RSA 测量 representation similarity 的角度不同：RSA 比较 pairwise\n      distance matrices 的 rank correlation，CKA 比较 kernel matrices 的\n      normalized alignment。CKA 对 representation 的 isotropic scaling 不敏感\n      但对 rotation 敏感，而 RSA（用 Spearman）对任何单调变换都不敏感。\n      这导致两个预期差异：(1) SigLIP→VLA 的 gap 在 CKA 下缩小（0.06 vs 0.127），\n      因为 LLM 的变换可能主要是 rotation-like（改变方向但保留部分 kernel\n      structure），RSA 放大了这种差异而 CKA 部分吸收；(2) 某些中间层 CKA 和\n      RSA 的 ordering 不一致——例如 layer 15 在 RSA 下 trained > untrained\n      但 CKA 下反转，因为该层的 trained model 做了 rotation 保持了 kernel\n      alignment 但改变了 rank order。这些 reversal 幅度很小（max 0.03）\n      且分布在中间层，不影响大局判断（SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO 在两个 metric\n      下都成立，trained ≈ untrained 在两个 metric 下都成立）。但 gap 缩小\n      意味着 reviewer 可能质疑 degradation 的 magnitude——\"CKA 显示 drop\n      只有 0.06 而不是 0.13\"。需要增加 metric robustness 分析段来正面\n      讨论两个 metric 的一致性（ordering preserved, τ=0.87）和分歧\n      （absolute gap differs due to metric sensitivity）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S2: RSA vs CKA comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"RSA ρ\", \"CKA\", \"RSA rank\", \"CKA rank\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Proj\", 0.615, 0.53, 1, 1]\n          - [\"Trained+inst\", 0.488, 0.47, 2, 3]\n          - [\"Trained−inst\", 0.489, 0.48, 3, 2]\n          - [\"Untrained+inst\", 0.485, 0.46, 4, 4]\n          - [\"Untrained−inst\", 0.480, 0.45, 5, 5]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, 0.38, 6, 6]\n      - name: \"Table S3: Metric agreement statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"Kendall τ (condition ordering)\", 0.87]\n          - [\"Per-layer ordering reversals\", \"4/33\"]\n          - [\"Max reversal magnitude\", 0.03]\n          - [\"Both metrics: SigLIP > VLA?\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Both metrics: trained ≈ untrained?\", \"Yes (CI includes 0)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Scatter plot: x=RSA ρ, y=CKA, 每个点是一个 condition×layer 组合。\n        对角线标注 perfect agreement。不同 condition 用不同颜色。大多数点\n        在对角线附近但 CKA 值系统性低于 RSA（点群偏向 x 轴）。\n        4 个 reversal layers 用 ×标记。\n    analysis: >\n      CKA 验证的核心结论：qualitative ordering preserved（τ=0.87），\n      quantitative gap shrinks。这是可以接受的——论文中增加一段\n      \"Metric Robustness Analysis\" 段落：(1) 报告 RSA 和 CKA 的 Kendall τ\n      确认 ordering 一致；(2) 解释 gap 差异来源（CKA 对 rotation 不敏感\n      → 吸收了 LLM 的 rotation-like transformation）；(3) 强调两个 metric\n      都支持 SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO 和 trained ≈ untrained 的核心结论。\n      4 个 layer-level reversals 放入 appendix 作 completeness，正文\n      不需要逐一讨论。主要风险：如果 reviewer 只看 CKA gap=0.06，可能\n      认为 degradation 不够 substantial——应对是强调 consistent direction\n      across two independent metrics 比 absolute magnitude 更重要。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial benchmark extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 LIBERO-Spatial benchmark 上重复全套核心分析（RSA component comparison,\n      2×2 matrix, per-layer curve），作为第三个 benchmark 交叉验证。\n      需要重新提取 features（GPU 4h），然后 CPU 分析。\n    expected_results:\n      # Core RSA comparison\n      spatial_siglip_proj_rsa: 0.58\n      spatial_trained_with_inst_rsa: 0.46\n      spatial_untrained_with_inst_rsa: 0.45\n      spatial_trained_no_inst_rsa: 0.46\n      spatial_untrained_no_inst_rsa: 0.44\n      spatial_dino_rsa: 0.35\n      # Key gaps\n      spatial_siglip_vs_vla_gap: 0.12\n      spatial_vla_vs_dino_gap: 0.11\n      spatial_training_effect: 0.01\n      spatial_instruction_effect: 0.01\n      # 2×2 matrix\n      spatial_2x2_range: [0.44, 0.46]\n      spatial_bootstrap_ci_includes_zero: true\n      # Per-layer\n      spatial_per_layer_spearman: -0.55\n      spatial_mid_layer_bump: true\n      spatial_bump_layers: \"10-14\"\n      # Cross-benchmark consistency\n      ordering_preserved_vs_libero_goal: true\n      absolute_rsa_shift: -0.03  # Spatial 整体略低于 Goal\n      qualitative_conclusions_identical: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 与 LIBERO-Goal 的关键差异：Spatial tasks 强调物体的\n      空间关系（\"put X next to Y\", \"place X on the shelf\"），而 Goal tasks\n      更多涉及功能性目标（\"open\", \"turn on\"）。Spatial tasks 的 action\n      structure 更依赖于 fine-grained spatial features，而 SigLIP 的\n      image-text contrastive pretraining 对 spatial 关系的编码不如对 object\n      identity 那么强——因此 SigLIP+projector RSA 略低（0.58 vs 0.615）。\n      同理 DINO 的 self-supervised features 对 spatial layout 的编码也\n      稍弱，RSA 从 0.388 降到 0.35。VLA hidden states 的 RSA 同比例下降\n      到 0.44-0.46 区间。关键的 qualitative conclusions 完全一致：\n      SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO ordering 保持，trained ≈ untrained 保持，\n      instruction effect 微弱保持。这为论文提供了重要的 robustness\n      evidence——在 task structure 不同的 benchmark 上结论 replicate。\n      但 absolute RSA 值整体下移约 0.03，说明 action-relevant structure\n      的 alignment 程度是 task-dependent 的。这是自然的——不同 task 家族\n      对 representation 的需求不同——但 reviewer 可能追问 \"如果换一个\n      更不同的 benchmark，gap 会不会消失？\"。应对是 Spatial 的 task\n      structure 已经与 Goal 足够不同（spatial vs functional），ordering\n      保持说明 finding 不是 benchmark-specific artifact。时间紧张时\n      此实验可降为 P3 放入 future work。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S4: Cross-benchmark RSA comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"LIBERO-Goal\", \"LIBERO-Spatial\", \"Δ\"]\n        sample_rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Proj\", 0.615, 0.580, -0.035]\n          - [\"Trained+inst\", 0.488, 0.460, -0.028]\n          - [\"Untrained+inst\", 0.485, 0.450, -0.035]\n          - [\"DINO\", 0.388, 0.350, -0.038]\n          - [\"SigLIP−VLA gap\", 0.127, 0.120, -0.007]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Grouped bar chart: LIBERO-Goal vs LIBERO-Spatial 并排，\n        6 个 conditions。虚线连接同一 condition 的两个 bars 以显示\n        parallel shift。关键 message：absolute values shift down\n        but ordering and gaps preserved。\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 作为第三个 benchmark 的价值是 ruling out benchmark-\n      specific artifact。Median 档下结果 qualitatively identical，\n      absolute values 略低但 gaps 保持。这足够支持论文声称\n      \"findings generalize across task families within LIBERO suite\"。\n      不能声称 generalize to arbitrary benchmarks（仍是同一 simulator，\n      同一 robot morphology），这在 Limitations 中需要标注。此实验 P2\n      优先级，如果 deadline 前完不成可以在 rebuttal 中补充——reviewer\n      大概率会要求第三个 benchmark，有这个 ready 比没有好。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e6435a05-1c9d-401f-aee5-cc27560a1a7b","total_cost_usd":0.36865800000000004,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18424,"cache_read_input_tokens":41802,"output_tokens":8777,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18424,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":8645,"cache_read_input_tokens":29961,"cache_creation_input_tokens":304,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":304},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":13077,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.013167,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":3,"outputTokens":8777,"cacheReadInputTokens":41802,"cacheCreationInputTokens":18424,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.35549100000000006,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"9adc2178-4b4f-47eb-9f31-eeead7619695"}
